NOTE ON THE CORPUS

The documents in example/corpus/ are derived from U.S. Centers for Medicare &
Medicaid Services (CMS) public datasets. U.S. government works are not subject
to copyright protection in the United States (17 U.S.C. Section 105). Each file
carries a provenance header naming its source URL, retrieval date, publication
date, and the exact subset taken.

The corpus deliberately excludes Local Coverage Determination policy bodies,
which carry AMA-licensed CPT content. The coverage documents here are indexes
only -- code, title, contractor, effective date -- and contain no procedure
codes and no coverage criteria.
